---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CategoryNav from '../components/nav/CategoryNav.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About MazeThis — Free Maze Generator & Printable Mazes"
  description="MazeThis provides free printable mazes and an online maze generator for kids, adults, teachers, and parents. Learn about our maze generation algorithm."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a></li>
        <li><svg class="w-3 h-3 mx-1 inline text-slate-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></li>
        <li><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium" aria-current="page">About</span></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="mb-4">About MazeThis</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6">
        MazeThis is a free maze platform built for teachers, parents, kids, and anyone who loves puzzles.
        We believe great mazes should be easy to find, print, and solve — no sign-up required.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-8 mb-3">What We Offer</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600">
        <li>✓ <strong>Free printable maze collections</strong> across 5 difficulty levels</li>
        <li>✓ <strong>Online maze generator</strong> — custom size and difficulty</li>
        <li>✓ <strong>Playable mazes</strong> — solve with arrow keys or touch</li>
        <li>✓ <strong>Print-friendly layouts</strong> — clean, no clutter</li>
        <li>✓ <strong>No account required</strong> — everything is free</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-8 mb-3">How Our Mazes Are Generated</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        All mazes are generated using a <strong>Recursive Backtracker</strong> algorithm — a depth-first
        search that carves passages through a grid. This produces mazes with satisfying winding corridors
        and is guaranteed to have exactly one solution path.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mt-3">
        Difficulty levels are controlled by post-processing: easier mazes have additional passages added
        to open up the grid, while hard mazes preserve maximum dead ends.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-8 mb-3">For Teachers & Parents</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        Our mazes are designed to be clean and printer-friendly. Simply click "Print Maze" on any maze
        page to get a clean version optimized for paper. All mazes are free to use for educational purposes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">Browse Mazes</h2>
      <CategoryNav />
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
